{"availability":"available","full":"salvodicara/d20-folio","name":"d20-folio","description":"d20 Folio — a free, bilingual (EN+IT), offline-first PWA for D&D 2024 players: character creation, play cockpit, campaigns. Built on the CC-BY SRD 5.2.1.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-17T11:06:57Z","updated":"2026-10-11T19:24:56Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://d20-folio.web.app","topics":["character-sheet","dnd","dnd-2024","firebase","i18n","pwa","react","srd","typescript"],"demo":"https://d20-folio.web.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:50:42.119Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T19:50:42.119Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T19:50:42.119Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T19:50:42.119Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A free, bilingual (English + Italian) PWA for D&D 2024 players to create, level up, play, and manage characters and campaigns. Offline-first, with the complete 2024 SRD pre-loaded and every rule auto-computed.","[]( [](./LICENSE) []( []( []( []( []( []( []( []("],"features":["Complete D&D 2024 SRD, pre-loaded. Classes and subclasses, spells, feats, species, backgrounds, equipment (weapons, armor, gear), magic items, and conditions ship as static TypeScript data and are referenced by srdId,…","Rules engine that automates mechanics, override-first. Every mechanic-bearing fact is a typed Grant on the SRD data. evaluateGrants aggregates them and drives derived stats (AC, proficiency bonus, spell save DC, attack…","SRD-aware creation and level-up wizards. The wizards suggest features, spells, and ability increases for you, applying 2024 rules correctly (background-based ASI, current 2024 species rules).","Character cockpit with play and edit modes. Inline editing in place (no detours to sub-pages), plus an immediate-commit combat model with a cost engine, condition gating, and rich in-combat casti